<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Genie Bot AI Copilot — Business Overview</title>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');

:root {
  --ink:     #0d1b2e;
  --ink2:    #1a2f4a;
  --blue:    #0f5299;
  --blue2:   #1a6fd4;
  --sky:     #e8f2ff;
  --green:   #0a6640;
  --mint:    #e6f7ef;
  --amber:   #b45309;
  --cream:   #f7f4ef;
  --cream2:  #f0ebe0;
  --red:     #c0392b;
  --rose:    #fdf0ee;
  --rule:    #d4c9b8;
  --muted:   #6b7a8d;
  --white:   #ffffff;
}

* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }

body {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.page {
  max-width: 1320px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 52px 56px 72px;
}

/* ── HEADER ── */
.masthead {
  border-top: 4px solid var(--blue);
  padding-top: 28px;
  margin-bottom: 44px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  gap: 32px;
  align-items: end;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding-bottom: 28px;
}

.masthead-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--blue2);
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.masthead-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 38px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.masthead-sub {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-weight: 300;
  max-width: 560px;
}

.masthead-right {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 6px;
}

.badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 5px 12px;
  border-radius: 3px;
}

.badge-blue   { background: var(--sky);  color: var(--blue);  border: 1px solid #b8d4f5; }
.badge-green  { background: var(--mint); color: var(--green); border: 1px solid #b3e0c8; }
.badge-amber  { background: #fef3e2;     color: var(--amber); border: 1px solid #f6d8a0; }

/* ── SECTION HEADER ── */
.section-hd {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  margin: 40px 0 20px;
}
.section-num {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--rule);
  line-height: 1;
  min-width: 32px;
}
.section-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.section-rule {
  flex: 1;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--rule);
}

/* ── PROBLEM / SOLUTION COMPARISON ── */
.compare-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 60px 1fr;
  gap: 0;
  align-items: stretch;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.compare-col {
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.compare-header {
  padding: 14px 20px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.compare-header-before {
  background: var(--rose);
  color: var(--red);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f5c6c0;
}

.compare-header-after {
  background: var(--mint);
  color: var(--green);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #b3e0c8;
}

.compare-body { padding: 20px; background: var(--white); }

.compare-mid {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--blue2);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.pain-item {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--ink2);
}
.pain-icon { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1px; }

/* ── WORKFLOW STEPS ── */
.workflow-container { margin-bottom: 36px; }

.step-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 0;
  margin-bottom: 0;
  position: relative;
}

.step-connector {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  width: 64px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.step-num-outer {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  z-index: 1;
}

.step-line {
  width: 2px;
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 20px;
}

.step-content {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 0 0 28px 0;
}

.step-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--white);
}

.step-card-header {
  padding: 14px 20px 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ebe0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
}

.step-who {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.step-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.step-body {
  padding: 16px 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: start;
}

.step-desc {
  font-size: 12.5px;
  color: var(--ink2);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.step-aside {
  min-width: 160px;
  max-width: 200px;
}

.aside-box {
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

.aside-blue  { background: var(--sky);  border: 1px solid #b8d4f5; color: var(--blue);  }
.aside-green { background: var(--mint); border: 1px solid #b3e0c8; color: var(--green); }
.aside-amber { background: #fef3e2;     border: 1px solid #f6d8a0; color: var(--amber); }
.aside-red   { background: var(--rose); border: 1px solid #f5c6c0; color: var(--red);   }

.aside-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.aside-line  { display: flex; gap: 5px; margin-top: 3px; align-items: flex-start; }
.aside-dot   { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 3px; }

/* Step colours */
.step-user    .step-num-outer { background: #e8f2ff;   color: var(--blue);  border: 2px solid var(--blue2); }
.step-user    .step-line      { background: #b8d4f5; }
.step-user    .step-who       { color: var(--blue2); }
.step-user    .step-card      { border-color: #b8d4f5; }
.step-user    .step-card-header { background: var(--sky); }

.step-ai      .step-num-outer { background: #f0e8ff;   color: #6b21a8; border: 2px solid #9b6dff; }
.step-ai      .step-line      { background: #d8c8f0; }
.step-ai      .step-who       { color: #7c3aed; }
.step-ai      .step-card      { border-color: #d8c8f0; }
.step-ai      .step-card-header { background: #f8f4ff; }

.step-hitl    .step-num-outer { background: var(--mint); color: var(--green); border: 2px solid var(--green); }
.step-hitl    .step-line      { background: #b3e0c8; }
.step-hitl    .step-who       { color: var(--green); }
.step-hitl    .step-card      { border-color: #b3e0c8; border-width: 2px; }
.step-hitl    .step-card-header { background: var(--mint); }

.step-outcome .step-num-outer { background: #e8f2ff; color: var(--blue); border: 2px solid var(--blue); }
.step-outcome .step-who       { color: var(--blue); }
.step-outcome .step-card      { border-color: #b8d4f5; }
.step-outcome .step-card-header { background: var(--sky); }

/* HITL callout label */
.hitl-flag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
}

/* ── BRANCH SECTION ── */
.branch-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  margin: 0 0 28px 64px;
}

.branch-card {
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  border: 1px solid;
}

.branch-resolved {
  border-color: #b3e0c8;
  background: var(--mint);
}
.branch-escalated {
  border-color: #b8d4f5;
  background: var(--sky);
}

.branch-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.branch-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.6; }

.branch-steps { margin-top: 10px; }
.branch-step {
  display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 11.5px;
  color: var(--ink2); margin-top: 6px; align-items: flex-start;
}
.branch-arrow { color: var(--blue2); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

/* ── KPI ROW ── */
.kpi-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.kpi-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 18px 16px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.kpi-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 3px;
}
.kpi-blue::before   { background: var(--blue2); }
.kpi-green::before  { background: var(--green); }
.kpi-amber::before  { background: var(--amber); }
.kpi-red::before    { background: var(--red); }
.kpi-purple::before { background: #7c3aed; }

.kpi-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.kpi-value {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.kpi-sub { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); }
.kpi-baseline { font-size: 10px; color: var(--red); margin-top: 4px; }

/* ── GOVERNANCE ── */
.gov-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.gov-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
}

.gov-title {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--blue);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}

.gov-item {
  display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 7px;
  font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.5;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.gov-tick { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

/* ── TIMELINE ── */
.timeline-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.timeline-phase {
  padding: 18px 20px;
  border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  background: var(--white);
  position: relative;
}
.timeline-phase:last-child { border-right: none; }
.timeline-phase:nth-child(even) { background: var(--cream); }

.phase-num {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--rule);
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.phase-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--blue2);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.phase-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.phase-item {
  font-size: 11.5px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 4px;
  padding-left: 10px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);
}
.phase-timeline {
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--blue);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

/* ── QUOTE BOX ── */
.quote-box {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--white);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 28px 36px;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 32px;
}

.quote-stat { text-align: center; }
.quote-num {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 44px;
  font-weight: 800;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74b9ff, #a29bfe);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  line-height: 1;
}
.quote-stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 6px; }
.quote-divider { width: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }

/* ── FOOTER ── */
.footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding-top: 20px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 10px;
  color: var(--muted);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}

/* Print-friendly */
@media print {
  body { background: white; }
  .page { padding: 24px 32px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- ══════════════════════ MASTHEAD ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="masthead">
    <div>
      <div class="masthead-label">Corporate & Investment Banking — Middle Office</div>
      <div class="masthead-title">Genie Bot AI Support Copilot</div>
      <div class="masthead-sub">How Agentic AI eliminates manual support effort — from error to resolution in minutes, not hours.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="masthead-right">
      <span class="badge badge-blue">AI Governance Forum Submission</span>
      <span class="badge badge-green">CIB Middle Office · May 2026</span>
      <span class="badge badge-amber">Ideation Phase — PoC Pending</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════ THE PROBLEM ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section-hd">
    <div class="section-num">1</div>
    <div class="section-title">The Problem We Are Solving</div>
    <div class="section-rule"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="compare-grid">
    <div class="compare-col">
      <div class="compare-header compare-header-before">✕ &nbsp;Today — The Manual Bottleneck</div>
      <div class="compare-body">
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">⏱</span><span>User encounters an error and must <strong>manually fill in a support template</strong> — often incomplete, inconsistent, and missing key technical data.</span></div>
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">🔍</span><span>L1 Support manually searches <strong>AWS S3 buckets</strong> to locate the relevant execution log for every incident — regardless of severity.</span></div>
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">🎫</span><span>L2 Jira tickets are <strong>manually created</strong> with incomplete information, leading to back-and-forth with users before diagnosis even begins.</span></div>
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">🔁</span><span>The <strong>same errors recur repeatedly</strong> with no systematic knowledge capture — every incident is treated as new.</span></div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px; padding:12px 14px; background:var(--rose); border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #f5c6c0;">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px">Total Mean Time to Resolution</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:var(--red);">65 – 125 minutes</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">per incident, consuming specialist L1 resource</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-mid">→</div>

    <div class="compare-col">
      <div class="compare-header compare-header-after">✓ &nbsp;With AI Copilot — Automated & Accelerated</div>
      <div class="compare-body">
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">🤖</span><span>User clicks one button. The AI <strong>automatically retrieves the error log</strong>, analyses the problem, and presents a plain-English explanation — no template to fill.</span></div>
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">⚡</span><span>AI checks <strong>all historical incidents</strong> simultaneously and identifies if this issue has been seen before — in seconds, not minutes.</span></div>
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">✅</span><span>If a known fix exists, user tries it. If the bot restarts successfully, a <strong>Jira ticket is auto-created and closed</strong>. Zero L1 involvement needed.</span></div>
        <div class="pain-item"><span class="pain-icon">📋</span><span>If escalation is needed, an <strong>L2 ticket is pre-filled with all required information</strong> — root cause, steps tried, logs attached — ready for specialist review.</span></div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px; padding:12px 14px; background:var(--mint); border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #b3e0c8;">
          <div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px">Total Mean Time to Resolution</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:var(--green);">Under 15 minutes</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">projected — 80%+ reduction from current baseline</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════ THE WORKFLOW ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section-hd">
    <div class="section-num">2</div>
    <div class="section-title">How It Works — Step by Step</div>
    <div class="section-rule"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="workflow-container">

    <!-- STEP 1 -->
    <div class="step-row step-user">
      <div class="step-connector">
        <div class="step-num-outer">1</div>
        <div class="step-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div>
              <div class="step-who">👤 Business User Action</div>
              <div class="step-title">Error Encountered — Click "Diagnose My Issue"</div>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-blue" style="font-size:9px">Takes 5 seconds</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <div class="step-desc">
              The Genie Bot encounters an error during its automated run. The end user — a non-technical business operations colleague — sees an error message and clicks the <strong>"Diagnose My Issue"</strong> button. They enter their User ID, the Run ID shown on screen, and their PC details. No support template to fill. No email to send. No phone call to make.
            </div>
            <div class="step-aside">
              <div class="aside-box aside-blue">
                <div class="aside-title">What user provides</div>
                <div class="aside-line"><span class="aside-dot">·</span> User ID (login)</div>
                <div class="aside-line"><span class="aside-dot">·</span> Run ID from error</div>
                <div class="aside-line"><span class="aside-dot">·</span> PC name</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 2 -->
    <div class="step-row step-ai">
      <div class="step-connector">
        <div class="step-num-outer">2</div>
        <div class="step-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div>
              <div class="step-who">🤖 AI Agents Working Automatically</div>
              <div class="step-title">Intelligent Analysis — Logs, History & Knowledge Base</div>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-amber" style="font-size:9px">15 – 30 seconds</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <div class="step-desc">
              Behind the scenes, three AI agents work simultaneously. The <strong>Log Agent</strong> automatically retrieves the full execution log from our secure cloud storage — no manual searching required. The <strong>History Agent</strong> checks whether this exact error has been raised before by any user. The <strong>Diagnosis Agent</strong> searches our AI knowledge base of resolved incidents and generates a plain-English explanation of what went wrong and what to try. All sensitive data is masked before being processed.
            </div>
            <div class="step-aside">
              <div class="aside-box aside-amber">
                <div class="aside-title">AI checks simultaneously</div>
                <div class="aside-line"><span class="aside-dot">·</span> Error log (S3)</div>
                <div class="aside-line"><span class="aside-dot">·</span> Open Jira tickets</div>
                <div class="aside-line"><span class="aside-dot">·</span> 100+ past incidents</div>
                <div class="aside-line"><span class="aside-dot">·</span> SOP knowledge base</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STEP 3 — DUPLICATE CHECK OUTCOME -->
    <div class="step-row step-ai">
      <div class="step-connector">
        <div class="step-num-outer">3</div>
        <div class="step-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-card-header">
            <div>
              <div class="step-who">🤖 AI Smart Routing — Duplicate Prevention</div>
              <div class="step-title">Is This Issue Already Being Worked On?</div>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-blue" style="font-size:9px">Instant</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <div class="step-desc">
